{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"おはよ。\nいこまだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日から沢山ブログ更新してる。\nみんな見てる〜？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんなにみてない〜ヽ(・∀・)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか言わないでっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんないこまは朝からニュースみてます！\n世の中のニュースを知る為に！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んでスッキリを見ていたら！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんとっ！\nまっちゅんと若様とテレンスリーさんといこまの四人で試写会をやらせてもらいました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エンドオブホワイトハウス"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"の主演\nジェラルド・バトラーさんが出ておりまて凄くかっこいいくて朝からときめいてしまいました♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"AKBさんの総選挙の日にちょうど公開初日でしたのよん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん！\nぜひ映画館へ行くのです！\nとにかくかっこいい！\n面白い！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"世界の政治の事も、ホワイトハウスがどんな建物なのかとかも知る事ができるのでぜひみて下さい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと大事なので二回目言いますが\nジェラルド・バトラーさん凄くかっこよいからっ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/11/1492076/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃねっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}